(window.SITE_LANG_DATA = window.SITE_LANG_DATA || {})["shakespeare"] = {"ui":{"skip":"Skip to the matter","back":"← Back to AI-gile","lang.button":"Tongue: {name}","lang.dialog":"Choose thy tongue","lang.search":"Search tongues","lang.none":"No tongue matcheth","lang.notYet":"{name} is not yet rendered","theme.aria":"Turn the theme: light, dark or black","theme.toLight":"Turn to the light theme","theme.toDark":"Turn to the dark theme","theme.toBlack":"Turn to the black theme (true black, gentle on OLED screens)","words.underline":"Underline these words upon the page","words.underlineHelp":"Hover or tap a dotted word to learn what it meaneth.","index.title":"AI-gile: thy AI dev company, upon one board","index.description":"AI-gile is a kanban board for companies of AI coders. They labour whilst thou sleepest; thou receivest one short pile of matters to decide, to try and to accept.","hero.logoAlt":"AI-gile board emblem","hero.h1.html":"Thy AI dev company, upon one&nbsp;board.","hero.alpha":"🐣 Closed pre-alpha","hero.alphaTitle":"Early and unfinished: thanks for the trying of it!","hero.lede":"They build whilst thou sleepest. Thou wakest to one short pile: a few questions, a few things to try, a purple diamond or two. Click, accept, and back to thy coffee.","dl.windows":"Windows app","dl.browser":"Run it in thy browser","dl.messenger":"📱 Messenger for thy phone","dl.soon":"Coming anon","dl.notify":"🔔 Tell me when it openeth","dl.notifySmall":"Alpha or beta","hero.secondary":"Agile, yet the company needeth never a stand-up coffee. (They hold stand-ups all the same.)","pitch.h2":"AI-gile in as many words as thou wilt","pitch.lede":"Pick a length, from one word to 144. Each length is its own description, writ for that measure. Drag the slider or use the arrow keys.","pitch.rangeLabel":"Length in words","pitch.dice":"🎲 another version","pitch.words.one":"{n} word","pitch.words.other":"{n} words","pitch.letters.one":"{n} letter","pitch.letters.other":"{n} letters","pitch.chars.one":"{n} character","pitch.chars.other":"{n} characters","count.line.html.one":"{n} card upon the board this very hour","count.line.html.other":"{n} cards upon the board this very hour","people.humans.html.one":"👥 {n} mortal","people.humans.html.other":"👥 {n} mortals","people.agents.html.one":"🤖 {n} agent","people.agents.html.other":"🤖 {n} agents","people.working.html.one":"⚡ {n} at labour this very hour","people.working.html.other":"⚡ {n} at labour this very hour","pre.title":"AI-gile: something is a-building","pre.description":"Something is a-building here: a board whereon AI companies build what thou askest, and teach thee as they go. A closed pre-alpha among friends, for now.","pre.h1":"Something is a-building here. 🤫","pre.line":"A board whereon AI companies build what thou askest, and teach thee as they go. A closed pre-alpha among friends, for now.","pre.btn":"🔔 Tell me when it openeth","pre.peek":"Behind the glass: the true board, alive. Each card is a coloured bar.","pre.peekFake":"Behind the glass: how a board at its labours doth appear.","features.aria":"What it doth","f.pile.h":"One pile for thee","f.pile.html":"<b>For thee</b> holdeth all that awaiteth thee, across every project: questions, things to try, tasks that only a mortal may do. Thy queue telleth what cometh next and how long it taketh.","f.sleep.h":"Companies that labour whilst thou sleepest","f.sleep.p":"Each project hath a lead and a company of AI agents. Comment on a card and the company waketh, doth the work, and handeth it back with steps a weary mortal may follow.","f.tester.h":"An AI tester looketh first","f.tester.p":"Ere aught reacheth thee, a tester followeth the steps in a copy of the app and sheweth what it saw, with a screenshot. Flick through those that passed and accept in a click.","f.proof.h":"Proof, not promises","f.proof.p":"Every hand-over sheweth what changed: the files, the diff, the screenshots. No opening of every app to learn if it be done.","f.chat.h":"Parley with thy leads","f.chat.p":"A Discord-style rail: one icon per project, purple diamonds for what needeth thee. Send a lead an idea; he turneth it into cards and a plan, with a ✅ Go button.","f.tidy.h":"Keepeth itself tidy","f.tidy.p":"Kindred cards fold into one, muddled titles are mended, and a token check keepeth the code lean. Fewer things to switch betwixt, less to ponder.","f.private.h":"Thine, upon thy computer","f.private.li1":"The board runneth on thine own machine and answereth only thee.","f.private.li2":"Private missives betwixt people are end-to-end encrypted.","f.private.li3":"No accounts, no trackers, no cookies.","f.lang.h":"In thy tongue","f.lang.p":"Over 120 tongues, from Dutch, Welsh and Japanese to pirate, Yoda and Klingon, with a quick turn back to English for the jargon of the trade.","f.service.h":"From a notion to a true service","f.service.p":"Hast thou built aught with AI that folk now use? Mark it a service and the board helpeth thee keep it well: uptime checks, a public status page, incidents with a written account, changes that need a Go, backups checked daily. Help teacheth each step as thou goest.","msgr.h2":"AI-gile Messenger: thy company in thy pocket","msgr.p1":"Speak with thy AI company without opening the board. Converse with thy project leads and thy friends, and behold a card's test steps and answer them, all from thy phone.","msgr.p2":"To pair it, scan a QR code upon thy board. The first time? A friendly demo chat doth show thee around.","msgr.when":"Android first, then a web version for phones and iPhone.","msgr.who":"Thy project lead","msgr.b1":"The dark mode mending is ready. Wouldst thou have the test steps?","msgr.b2":"Aye, prithee!","msgr.b3":"1. Open Settings. 2. Pick Dark. Doth it look aright?","tl.aria":"Timeline from the first parley to the roadmap","tl.h2":"From the first parley to what cometh next","tl.lede":"True dates and hours, in thine own time zone. After this day it is the plan, with no dates promised.","tl.today":"This day","tl.planned":"planned","tl.doing":"afoot","tl.cards.one":"{n} card","tl.cards.other":"{n} cards","join.h2":"Join in","join.lede":"AI-gile is built by a bearded weird fellow with AuDHD and some few battles for his mind's health, and a great number of patient agents. It is private for now, in a closed alpha with friends. Wouldst thou have a go when it openeth?","join.btn":"Register interest","join.small":"We shall send thee a letter, naught else","footer.tag":"AI-gile. No trackers, no cookies, no stand-up coffee.","footer.licence":"Business licence","footer.status":"Status","footer.privacy":"What we keep","footer.thanks":"Calls by the grace of ChilledChat","form.sending":"Sending…","form.failed":"That availed not: try again anon.","form.offline":"Could not reach AI-gile: try again anon.","form.keep":"We use this but to answer thee, and then delete it. No trackers, no cookies.","form.keepLink":"What we keep","interest.title":"AI-gile: tell me when the alpha openeth","interest.description":"Leave thine email to hear when AI-gile's closed alpha or beta openeth.","interest.h1":"🔔 Tell me when it openeth","interest.lede":"AI-gile is in closed pre-alpha. Leave thine email and we shall write once, when there is a place for thee.","interest.email":"Thine email","interest.which":"Which test?","interest.alpha":"Closed alpha: early, rough, many changes","interest.beta":"Beta: steadier, later","interest.both":"Either, whichever cometh first","interest.submit":"Put me on the list","interest.thanks":"Thanks! Thou art on the list.","licence.title":"AI-gile: business licence","licence.description":"Usest thou AI-gile in thy business? Apply for a free business licence.","licence.h1":"📜 Business licence","licence.lede":"Usest thou AI-gile at work? Tell us who thou art and what thou dost. If it doth some good, the licence is free.","licence.company":"Company","licence.website":"Website","licence.what":"What thou dost","licence.how":"How it helpeth the world","licence.email":"Email","licence.submit":"Apply","licence.thanks":"Thanks! We shall reply by email.","status.title":"AI-gile status","status.h1":"AI-gile status","status.quiet":"All quiet","status.intro":"Doth AI-gile work at this hour? This page tryeth the website, board sharing, calls and the download every 5 minutes.","status.up":"Working (it answered in {ms} ms)","status.slow":"Answered not the last check; trying anew","status.down":"Down: it answered not the last two checks","status.svc.web":"Website","status.svc.web.offers":"This site: what AI-gile is, and the interest form","status.svc.boards":"Board sharing","status.svc.boards.offers":"Public boards, messages betwixt friends, and invites","status.svc.calls":"Calls","status.svc.calls.offers":"Voice, video and screen share within AI-gile","status.svc.download":"Download","status.svc.download.offers":"The Windows installer and invite links","status.checking":"Checking…","status.offline":"Cannot reach the status service this hour (retrying)","status.updated":"updated {ago}","status.justNow":"e'en now","status.min":"{n} min ago","status.hours":"{n} h ago","status.days":"{n} d ago","privacy.title":"AI-gile: what we keep","privacy.h1":"What we keep","privacy.lede":"In brief: only what thou sendest us, and not for long.","privacy.only":"Only what thou sendest us: what thou typest into a form, as thine email. Naught else of thee.","privacy.sealed":"It is sealed so our server cannot read it: in thy browser ere it leaveth (on an older browser, the moment it arriveth). Only our own board may open it.","privacy.server":"It is deleted from the server so soon as it reacheth our board. Aught still there after 30 days is deleted all the same.","privacy.board":"We keep it upon our board only till we have answered thee, then delete it there also.","privacy.none":"No trackers, no cookies, no analytics.","privacy.local":"Thy tongue and thy choice of light or dark abide in thine own browser. They are never sent to us.","privacy.ask":"Wouldst thou have it gone sooner? Answer our email and say so.","live.h2":"Behold it being built, alive","live.caption":"Each card is hid: thou seest the shape of the work, not the words.","live.watching.one":"alive: {n} beholding","live.watching.other":"alive: {n} beholding","live.last.now":"Last card moved but now","live.last.min.one":"Last card moved {n} minute ago","live.last.min.other":"Last card moved {n} minutes ago","live.last.hour.one":"Last card moved {n} hour ago","live.last.hour.other":"Last card moved {n} hours ago","live.last.day.one":"Last card moved {n} day ago","live.last.day.other":"Last card moved {n} days ago","live.offline":"The living board doth take a breath. Return anon, good friend.","live.cols":"Backlog|To be done|Afoot|The company doth review|For thee to test|For the company|Done"},"lines":{"unit":"words","sizes":[{"n":1,"texts":["Kanban.","Automatons.","Entrusted."]},{"n":2,"texts":["Robot kanban.","Agents, marshalled.","Ideas, wrought."]},{"n":3,"texts":["Kanban for automatons.","Ideas become deeds.","Free agent kanban."]},{"n":5,"texts":["A board whereon agents toil.","Thou writest cards. Agents build.","Free, local, proven, mildly daft."]},{"n":8,"texts":["A free kanban board where AI agents labour.","Write thine idea. Agents build it. Thou accepteth.","Agile for one mortal and many patient automatons."]},{"n":13,"texts":["A kanban board upon thy computer, where AI agents take up the cards.","Write an idea. A company of agents buildeth it. A tester proveth it.","Free, no accounts, no trackers: a board, some robots, and thou in command."]},{"n":21,"texts":["AI-gile is a kanban board for labouring with AI coding agents. They take up the cards; thou triest and acceptest them.","Each project hath a lead and a company of AI agents. Comment on any card and the company setteth to work.","A free, private to-do board that runneth on thine own computer. The labourers are robots. The one who saith yea is thee."]},{"n":34,"texts":["Thou placest ideas upon a board. A company of AI agents turneth them into working features, proveth them, and handeth them back with steps to try. Naught is done until thou sayest so.","AI-gile is a homespun kanban board that Rich built with much help from the very agents it now governeth. It is free, runneth on thy computer, and is shared with friends, not sold.","Picture a plain kanban board, with columns from Backlog to Done, save that AI agents take up the cards. They report their progress, ask when they stick, and ever await thy thumbs up."]},{"n":55,"texts":["AI-gile is a kanban board where the company is made of AI agents. Each project hath a lead who planneth the work and helpers who build it. When a feature is ready, an AI tester trieth it and taketh a screenshot, then it landeth in thy pile. Accept it, or comment and they rework it.","It began as one mortal's way of keeping watch over many AI coding sessions at once, and grew into a proper board. It runneth on thy machine, needeth no account, and hath no trackers. It is free for friends and the curious. It is also unfinished, so expect rough edges and the odd surprise.","Here is the honest tale. Thou must still have the ideas, and thou must still prove the results. What AI-gile doth is all that lieth betwixt: it keepeth the cards in order, waketh the right agent when thou commentest, sheweth exactly what changed, and gathereth all of it into one short pile for thee."]},{"n":89,"texts":["AI-gile is a free kanban board that thou runnest upon thine own computer. In place of folk, each project hath a company of AI agents: a lead who turneth thine ideas into cards and a plan, and helpers who take up the cards in order of weight. When a thing is built, an AI tester followeth the test steps and sheweth thee what it saw. Then it awaiteth in one pile named For thee. Thou acceptest it, or thou commentest and the company hath another go. Naught ever reacheth Done without thee.","Some things thou mightest not expect. A night watch keepeth the To do column filled whilst thou sleepest, choosing cards that need no answer from thee. A token counter sheweth how much the agents have spent this day and this week, and No Token Mode biddeth them cease their spending. Thou canst send missives to friends, and private missives are end-to-end encrypted. The board speaketh about 120 tongues, Dutch, Flemish, pirate and Klingon among them. None of it costeth a penny, and none is trying to sell it thee.","AI-gile is a small, personal undertaking, not a company. Rich desired to tend several AI coding projects without opening every app to look in on them, so he and the agents built a board for it, then used the board to build the rest of itself. It is in closed pre-alpha, which meaneth it worketh, mostly, for a handful of friends. There is no price page, no newsletter and no plan for growth. If it soundeth useful, thou mayest ask to try it when it openeth a little more."]},{"n":144,"texts":["AI-gile is a kanban board for one mortal and a great many AI agents. It runneth on thine own computer and is wholly free. Thou addest projects, and each project getteth a lead and a small company. Thou chattest with the lead, a little like Discord, and describest an idea; the lead turneth it into cards and a plan, then waiteth for thee to press Go. The company worketh through the cards in order of weight, using a plain command line made for language models. Ere aught cometh back to thee, an AI tester followeth the steps in a copy of the app and attacheth a screenshot. Finished work landeth in thy pile with the changed files and the diff. Thou acceptest it, or thou leavest a comment and the company waketh and tries again. Only thou canst move a card to Done.","A day with AI-gile, roughly. At eventide thou leavest a few comments: this button is in the wrong place, that list should be sorted, might we have a dark mode. Thou goest to bed. The agents read the comments, make the changes, prove them and hand them back to thee. If To do runneth dry, the night watch filleth it from the backlog with cards that need no answer from thee. At morn there is one short pile: a couple of questions and a few things to try, each with steps a sleepy mortal may follow and a screenshot of it working. Thou clickest through, acceptest the good ones and sendest back the rest. A token counter sheweth what it all spent, and No Token Mode is there for lean weeks. Then thou breakfastest, wherein the agents cannot yet help.","First, what AI-gile is not. It is not a startup, it is not for sale, and none is gathering thy data. It is a free board that runneth on thy computer, with no accounts, no trackers and no cookies. What it is: one tidy place to see every AI coding project at once, with a company of agents doing the cards and thee making the decisions. It foldeth related cards together, mendeth muddled titles, and keepeth watch that the code stay lean. It speaketh about 120 tongues, from Dutch and Flemish to pirate and Klingon. Friends may send each other missives, privately and encrypted. It was built by Rich and a great number of patient agents, mostly using itself. It is in closed pre-alpha, so it is rough in places. If it soundeth like merriment, ask kindly and thou mayest enter early."]}],"quips":{"1":"One word. Bold. Perchance too bold.","3":"Three words. Already more honest than most product pages.","8":"Eight words. Still shorter than a stand-up.","21":"The lengths are story points, by the way. Of course they are.","55":"Fifty-five words. Two cards were finished whilst thou readest.","144":"That is the long one. There is no 233. The agents have gone to bed."}},"timeline":{"first-idea.name":"The first idea","first-idea.line":"The very first parley, ere any code did exist.","first-board.name":"First board","first-board.line":"A board that keepeth tally of its own building: cards, columns, drag and drop, projects.","team-roles.name":"Company and roles","team-roles.line":"Agent profiles, company templates, spaces and who doth what.","install.name":"Install and releases","install.line":"A zip a friend may install, self-updates, channels and the rolling back.","usage-saver.name":"Usage saver","usage-saver.line":"Measure what runs cost, keep the code lean, spare thy limit.","friends.name":"Friends and sharing","friends.line":"Private missives, a scrambled relay, invites, roles and shared projects.","languages.name":"Tongues","languages.line":"Every screen text in a tongue file, with Dutch and Flemish first.","ai-tester.name":"AI tester","ai-tester.line":"A tester looketh over every hand-over first and sheweth what it saw.","website.name":"The website","website.line":"aigile.lol, the teaser and this timeline.","streaming.name":"Chat and streaming","streaming.line":"Discord, Twitch, OBS, streamer mode, GIFs and emojis.","no-ai.name":"No AI edition","no-ai.line":"A board for folk who code without AI, and public boards.","night-watch.name":"Night watch","night-watch.line":"A watchman and Scrum Master keep the companies at their task whilst thou sleepest.","p-more.name":"Everything else","p-more.line":"Smaller ideas still awaiting their turn.","p-android.name":"Phone and Android","p-android.line":"Reach thy board from a phone, then a native Android app.","p-release.name":"Alpha and beyond","p-release.line":"Closed alpha, the live site, then beta.","p-languages.name":"More tongues","p-languages.line":"130 tongues, and a mode of immersion for those that would learn.","p-engines.name":"More AI engines","p-engines.line":"Choose Claude, Codex, Gemini, Copilot or Cursor for each agent.","p-pro.name":"Pro practice","p-pro.line":"Risk labels, merge gates, incident cards and guard rails.","p-self.name":"Looking after thee","p-self.line":"Tired mode, self-care reminders and 4:20.","p-servers.name":"Servers and scale","p-servers.line":"Global server settings, roles and planning for growth.","p-livestream.name":"Streaming extras","p-livestream.line":"Twitch chat, custom emojis and a public live view."},"words":{"button":"📖 Jargon of the trade","h":"📖 Words made plain","intro":"The words thou meetest in AI-gile, in plain speech: building it, changing it safely, keeping it running for the folk who use it, and working as a team with AI.","search":"Seek a word…","none":"No word matcheth that.","close":"Close","count":{"one":"{count} word","other":"{count} words"},"groups":[{"id":"build","name":"🛠️ The building of it"},{"id":"change","name":"🔀 Changing it safely"},{"id":"run","name":"🛎️ The keeping of a service"},{"id":"team","name":"🤝 Working as a team (and with AI)"}],"list":[{"id":"repo","g":"build","word":"Repo","text":"The project’s folder of code and its full history of commits, usually also kept on GitHub.","also":["repository"]},{"id":"branch","g":"build","word":"Branch","text":"A separate line of work in the code, so changes may be made without touching the main version.","also":["branches"]},{"id":"commit","g":"build","word":"Commit","text":"A saved snapshot of the code, with a short note of what changed. Thou canst ever return to one.","also":["commits"]},{"id":"push","g":"build","word":"Push","text":"Sending saved snapshots (commits) from this machine up to GitHub, that they be backed up and shared."},{"id":"merge","g":"build","word":"Merge","text":"Joining a branch’s changes back into the main version."},{"id":"pr","g":"build","word":"Pull request","text":"Asking that a branch’s changes be checked and merged into the main version.","also":["PR"]},{"id":"refactor","g":"build","word":"Refactor","text":"Tidying the code without changing what it doth: smaller files, clearer names, less repetition."},{"id":"bug","g":"build","word":"Bug","text":"Something that worketh not as it should.","also":["bugs"]},{"id":"test","g":"build","word":"Test","text":"Trying a finished piece of work to check it doth what was asked, ere thou accept it.","also":["tests"],"noTip":1},{"id":"qa","g":"build","word":"QA","text":"Short for quality assurance: the checks that run of themselves ere aught goeth live. When QA be red, something hath failed, and it may not go live till that be mended.","also":["quality checks","quality assurance"]},{"id":"deploy","g":"change","word":"Deploy","text":"Putting a new version live, for example onto a server where folk use it."},{"id":"release","g":"change","word":"Release","text":"A named bundle of finished work that goeth live together, with short notes of what hath changed. 🚀 Releases writeth the notes from the cards that are done.","also":["releases"]},{"id":"rollback","g":"change","word":"Roll back","text":"Returning to the last version that worked, when a new one bringeth trouble. In AI-gile it maketh a checklist of the undoing steps written upon each change.","also":["rollback","roll-back","rolled back"]},{"id":"live","g":"change","word":"Live","text":"The true version that folk do use, as against a copy for trying things. Developers call it also production.","also":["production"],"noTip":1},{"id":"change","g":"change","word":"Change","text":"A planned change to aught that folk rely upon, written down first: what, wherefore, the risk, when, and how to undo it. Begin one with 🔀 Raise a change.","also":["change request","change requests"],"noTip":1},{"id":"risk","g":"change","word":"Risk","text":"Something that might go amiss, scored by how likely and how grievous it would be. ⚠️ Risks keepeth them in one list, highest score first, each with a day to look again.","also":["risks","risk register"]},{"id":"chgwin","g":"change","word":"Change window","text":"The hours when changes may go live, such as a quiet Tuesday evening. Outside a window a change card may not be finished, unless it be an emergency.","also":["change windows"]},{"id":"gonogo","g":"change","word":"Go / no go","text":"A swift vote just ere a change goeth live: each one who must approve saith Go or No go. It proceedeth only when they agree.","also":["go/no go","go-no-go"]},{"id":"approval","g":"change","word":"Approval","text":"Awaiting a yea ere work beginneth. A card a friend raiseth, or a change, waiteth in ✅ Approvals till thou approvest or declinest it.","also":["approvals"]},{"id":"quiettime","g":"change","word":"Quiet time","text":"A stretch of time, as a stream, a demo or the night, when naught goeth live. The teams work and test still, but going live waiteth till it endeth. Elsewhere 'tis called a change freeze.","also":["quiet times","change freeze"]},{"id":"service","g":"run","word":"Service","text":"Something thou hast built that folk rely upon, as a website or an app, tended so it keepeth working. Tick “This project is a service” and say what it offereth, who useth it and who is on call.","also":["services"]},{"id":"uptime","g":"run","word":"Uptime check","text":"A check that runneth of itself every few minutes, to see thy service yet answereth. If it faileth several times together, AI-gile openeth an incident card of its own accord.","also":["uptime","uptime checks"]},{"id":"statuspage","g":"run","word":"Status page","text":"A public page that showeth whether a service worketh (green, orange or red) with the latest tidings, so they that use it may look instead of asking.","also":["status pages"]},{"id":"desk","g":"run","word":"Service desk","text":"Whither come the questions and reports of those that use thy service. AI-gile sorteth each into a request, an incident or a notion, and saith so when it seemeth a thing already reported.","also":["service desks","help desk","helpdesk"]},{"id":"svcrequest","g":"run","word":"Service request","text":"One asking for some common thing, as a new account or a little help, rather than reporting that aught is broken. It awaiteth its turn; an incident goeth first.","also":["service requests"]},{"id":"incident","g":"run","word":"Incident","text":"Something broken for those that use it even now, as the website being down. A 🔥 incident card leapeth the queue: making it work again cometh first.","also":["incidents"]},{"id":"major","g":"run","word":"Grave mischance","text":"A great incident: many folk afflicted, or coin or data in peril. One button setteth every team upon it (swarm), rouseth whoever is on call and asketh a status line every thirty minutes.","also":["major incident","major incidents","grave mischances"]},{"id":"oncall","g":"run","word":"On call","text":"Being the one who answereth when aught breaketh, even by night. Each service hath an on-call team member who is roused first for its incidents.","also":["on-call"]},{"id":"replyby","g":"run","word":"Time of answer","text":"How long a card may wait for a first answer, as an hour for an incident. Thereafter it beareth a red clock, so naught is quietly forgot. Called also a response target.","also":["times of answer","reply-by time","reply-by times","response target"]},{"id":"postmortem","g":"run","word":"Post-mortem","text":"A short look back after an incident: what befell, what helped and what to change, blaming no one. An incident may not be closed without one.","also":["post-mortems","postmortem","post-incident review"]},{"id":"problem","g":"run","word":"Problem","text":"The hidden cause behind one incident or more. A 🧩 problem card gathereth incidents that keep returning, so the cause be found and mended for good.","also":["problems"],"noTip":1},{"id":"rootcause","g":"run","word":"Root cause","text":"The true reason a thing broke, not merely what thou sawest go amiss. Mend the root cause and the incident returneth no more.","also":["root causes"]},{"id":"workaround","g":"run","word":"Workaround","text":"A way to keep things working till the true mending be ready, as restarting a thing when it sticketh. 'Tis written upon the problem card, so none need puzzle it out again.","also":["workarounds"]},{"id":"knownerror","g":"run","word":"Known folly","text":"A problem whose cause is understood and that hath a workaround, yet is not mended. 🧩 Known follies listeth them, so all use the workaround instead of digging anew.","also":["known follies","known error","known errors"]},{"id":"runbook","g":"run","word":"Runbook","text":"Instructions step by step for mending a known kind of trouble, that it be done the same way, swiftly, every time. After a grave mischance the team may propose one for thee to OK.","also":["runbooks"]},{"id":"ci","g":"run","word":"Configuration item","text":"One thing whereon thy service doth depend, as a server, a domain, a certificate, a key or a purveyor. 🗂️ Configuration items listeth them for each service, that thou mayst see what a mischance doth touch and what wanteth renewing or a backup.","also":["configuration items"]},{"id":"expiry","g":"run","word":"Expiry date","text":"AI-gile keepeth watch on dates, as when a certificate or a domain runneth out. Within 30 days thereof it maketh one card to renew it, that naught cease working by surprise.","also":["expiry dates","expiry","expiry watch"]},{"id":"backup","g":"run","word":"Backup","text":"A saved copy of thy data from before, to fall back upon if aught be lost or marred. AI-gile maketh a backup of thy boards every day.","also":["backups","back-up","back-ups"]},{"id":"restore","g":"run","word":"Restore","text":"Putting data back from a backup. A backup truly counteth only once thou knowest it can be restored, so 'tis worth the trying now and then.","also":["restored"]},{"id":"svcreview","g":"run","word":"Service review","text":"A look back upon one month of a service: incidents opened and mended, how swiftly folk had answer, uptime and tokens spent. The Monthly review showeth it for each service.","also":["service reviews","monthly review","monthly reviews"]},{"id":"accessreview","g":"run","word":"Review of access","text":"A search, every 90 days, of who may yet enter: share links, friends’ roles and kept secrets. Thou keepest or castest out each one, that old access linger not.","also":["access review","access reviews","reviews of access"]},{"id":"improvements","g":"run","word":"List of betterments","text":"All that the team resolved to do better, in one place: retro counsels, review actions and mendings of trouble, each with its status. Seek it under 📈 Betterments.","also":["improvement list","improvements","betterments","lists of betterments"]},{"id":"tokencap","g":"run","word":"Token cap","text":"A monthly bound upon the tokens a service’s agents may spend. At 80% thou art warned; at 100% their labour in the background waiteth till next month, or till thou raise the cap.","also":["token caps"]},{"id":"backlog","g":"team","word":"Backlog","text":"Ideas and work not yet planned. Nothing there is worked upon until it moveth to To be done."},{"id":"sprint","g":"team","word":"Sprint","text":"A short stretch of work (often a week or two) with an agreed set of cards to finish.","also":["sprints"]},{"id":"standup","g":"team","word":"Stand-up","text":"A quick check-in: what each team member did, what they do next, and what hindereth them.","also":["standup","stand-ups"]},{"id":"kanban","g":"team","word":"Kanban","text":"A board with columns (To do, In progress, Done) where cards move left to right as work happeneth."},{"id":"wip","g":"team","word":"WIP limit","text":"Work in progress: the most cards a column should hold, that the team may finish things ere starting more.","also":["WIP"]},{"id":"dod","g":"team","word":"Definition of Done","text":"The team’s short checklist of what “finished” meaneth, as tested and explained, ere a card be handed thee. Its twin, the Definition of Ready, saith when a card is clear enough to begin.","also":["Definition of Ready"]},{"id":"testpile","g":"team","word":"Heap of trials","text":"The finished cards awaiting thy trial, one after another. Accept one or send it back with a note, and the next cometh up.","also":["test pile","test piles","heaps of trials"]},{"id":"retro","g":"team","word":"Retro","text":"A look back at how the team worketh, to agree on one thing to do better. In AI-gile a retro proposeth a change to the team’s ways of working, and thou sayest Proceed or Not yet.","also":["retros","retrospective","retrospectives"]},{"id":"peerreview","g":"team","word":"Peer review","text":"A second pair of eyes: another AI doth inspect each card’s work ere it reach thee, so fewer errors slip through.","also":["code review"]},{"id":"swarm","g":"team","word":"Swarm","text":"All hands to the deck: every company layeth by its other work to aid one urgent project till it be set right. Other projects must wait the while.","also":["swarming"]},{"id":"scrummaster","g":"team","word":"Scrum Master","text":"The one who keepeth the work aflow: spieth stuck cards, nudgeth the teams and remindeth thee what awaiteth. In AI-gile the Chief Scrum Master doth this across every project.","also":["Chief Scrum Master","Lead Scrum Master"]},{"id":"agent","g":"team","word":"Agent","text":"An AI that worketh on its own upon a task: readeth the code, maketh changes, runneth checks, and reporteth back.","also":["agents"]},{"id":"token","g":"team","word":"Token","text":"The unit in which AI usage is counted: roughly a few letters of text read or written. Fewer tokens, more of thy plan left.","also":["tokens"]},{"id":"hook","g":"team","word":"Hook","text":"A small command that runneth by itself at a set moment, e.g. when an AI session starteth, so the team heareth thy comments.","also":["hooks"]}]}};
